[Mission.Objectives]
Repel all German attacks, then launch a counterattack.
[Mission.Description]
German units are within sight of the Kremlin. Moscow must not fall to the fascists!

Your orders:
	- Blunt the enemy attack and stall their advance on Moscow
	- Launch a counter-attack
